              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jeremiah said to them: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Thus you shall say to Zedekiah, ‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel: Behold, I will turn back the weapons of war which are in your hands and with which you are fighting against the king of Babylon and against the Chaldeans who are besieging you outside the walls; and I will bring them together into the midst of this city. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I myself will fight against you with outstretched hand and strong arm, in anger, and in fury, and in great wrath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will smite the inhabitants of this city, both man and beast; they shall die of a great pestilence. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afterward, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", I will give Zedekiah king of Judah, and his servants, and the people in this city who survive the pestilence, sword, and famine, into the hand of Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon and into the hand of their enemies, into the hand of those who seek their lives. He shall smite them with the edge of the sword; he shall not pity them, or spare them, or have compassion.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And to this people you shall say: ‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": Behold, I set before you the way of life and the way of death. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He who stays in this city shall die by the sword, by famine, and by pestilence; but he who goes out and surrenders to the Chaldeans who are besieging you shall live and shall have his life as a prize of war. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I have set my face against this city for evil and not for good, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": it shall be given into the hand of the king of Babylon, and he shall burn it with fire.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
